## To coreBuiltinMin (args: Seq of CVal) -> CVal:
    Let arg1 be item 1 of args.
    Let arg2 be item 2 of args.
    Inspect arg1:
        When VInt (int1):
            Inspect arg2:
                When VInt (int2):
                    Return a new VInt with value min(int1, int2).
                When VFloat (real2):
                    Return a new VFloat with value min((int1 + 0.0), real2).
                Otherwise:
                    Return a new VError with msg "min() requires numbers".
        When VFloat (real1):
            Inspect arg2:
                When VInt (int2):
                    Return a new VFloat with value min(real1, (int2 + 0.0)).
                When VFloat (real2):
                    Return a new VFloat with value min(real1, real2).
                Otherwise:
                    Return a new VError with msg "min() requires numbers".
        Otherwise:
            Return a new VError with msg "min() requires numbers".

## To coreBuiltinMinuteOf (args: Seq of CVal) -> CVal:
    Let arg1 be item 1 of args.
    Inspect arg1:
        When VMoment (moment1):
            Return a new VInt with value minute_of(moment1).
        When VDate (date1):
            Return a new VError with msg "a Date has no time-of-day — use a timestamp/Moment".
        Otherwise:
            Let got1 be coreTypeName(arg1).
            Return a new VError with msg "a date component extractor requires a Moment or Date, got {got1}".

