## To coreBuiltinMonthsBetween (args: Seq of CVal) -> CVal:
    Let arg1 be item 1 of args.
    Let arg2 be item 2 of args.
    Inspect arg1:
        When VMoment (moment1):
            Inspect arg2:
                When VMoment (moment2):
                    Return a new VInt with value months_between(moment1, moment2).
                Otherwise:
                    Let got1 be coreTypeName(arg1).
                    Let got2 be coreTypeName(arg2).
                    Return a new VError with msg "months_between() requires two Moments, got {got1} and {got2}".
        Otherwise:
            Let got1 be coreTypeName(arg1).
            Let got2 be coreTypeName(arg2).
            Return a new VError with msg "months_between() requires two Moments, got {got1} and {got2}".

